{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WKEKTs9dSVzuF66NFVZft4","type":"tool_result","content":"4465:      // head in layers: hair mass behind, a face set slightly forward, a hair cap with bangs, then eyes, brows and mouth\n4506:      // face: eyes (with a catch-light when big enough), brows and a mouth, on the side facing the camera\n4519:      if (u > 1.9) {   // mouth: expr 'smile' | 'shout' | 'angry' | 'wince', and it moves while the rig talks (Dialog portraits)\n4884:  /** new E.Blob({ R: 6.5, colors, ears, horns, wings, feet, tail, mouth, face }): a squash-and-stretch rig for slimes and\n4887:    /** o: its options (R: the radius, 6.5; ears, horns, wings, feet, tail, mouth, face, colors) */\n4911:   *   mouth: true | 'fangs', face: 'front' (eyes always on the camera side, for Mana-style monsters)\n4970:    if (o.mouth && shown) {\n4973:      if (o.mouth === 'fangs') { px.dot(g, mx - 1, my + 1, '#ffffff'); px.dot(g, mx + 1, my + 1, '#ffffff'); }\n9011:        else { this.portrait._talk = this.typing; this.portrait.drawPortrait(g, px0, py0, d.P, Object.assign({ bg: shade(Array.isArray(this.bg) ? this.bg[0] : this.bg, .12), border: this.border, \n10704:// Sierra's icons, drawn: feet, an eye, a hand, a mouth\n13234:    if (s.tunnel) {   // walls from beyond the rumble up to a roof; where it starts, a face round its mouth","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"545d9604-3eac-4c35-9b61-7066df831e99","uuid":"0b3df32c-b807-4c61-9632-d6bdd4a417ee","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:52:44.438Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"4465:      // head in layers: hair mass behind, a face set slightly forward, a hair cap with bangs, then eyes, brows and mouth\n4506:      // face: eyes (with a catch-light when big enough), brows and a mouth, on the side facing the camera\n4519:      if (u > 1.9) {   // mouth: expr 'smile' | 'shout' | 'angry' | 'wince', and it moves while the rig talks (Dialog portraits)\n4884:  /** new E.Blob({ R: 6.5,