{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghzuTBvqJ8GkoyjqdFBG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016GpLMYzTE6dLq8rucmbdyJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes for Cricket Kerfuffle (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, handoff copy)\n\n1. Humanoid `weapon: 'bat'`: a flat willow cricket bat (handle `colors.grip`, blade `colors.willow`, a sticker band in\n   `colors.trim`, a toe), the length is `bladeLen`; the free hand is drawn on the handle (a two-handed grip). The swing\n   smear and `tip()` treat it like a blade. Why: the rig had swords, guns and staves, and cricket needs a bat.\n2. Humanoid `pads: true`: white batting pads over the knee and shin, with a buckle in `colors.trim`.\n3. Humanoid face furniture: `face: { moustache: 'walrus' | 'handlebar', beard: true, glasses: true }` (colour\n   `colors.facial`, else the hair). Why: the cast (Basil's walrus, Thrumpton's handlebar, Dev's glasses) is the comedy.\n4. Button symbols: the standard Controller setting defaults to PlayStation, with Xbox (A B X Y) as the one other choice\n   (the input's default `glyphs` is 'playstation'). Why: the brief asks for PlayStation glyphs, Xbox from Settings.\n5. Create + Options belongs to the AI Hub: while `game.hubActive` is set and the `hubCreate` action (Pad8) is held,\n   the pause button does not pause (both the main and the extra players' pause checks).\n6. TileMap floor bakes: the cache keeps up to 10 baked floors (was 6), so the match's cameras never re-bake.\nEOF\nmv CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md ../engine-CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md 2>/dev/null; mv ../engine-CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md ./CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md; ls","description":"Write the engine change log"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1308,"cache_read_input_tokens":342645,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1308},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"545d9604-3eac-4c35-9b61-7066df831e99","uuid":"531b2183-2903-465e-9bdd-4a21d524139e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:53:08.502Z","request_id":"req_011CghzuSu4SZHvk4hMdMbtQ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_016GpLMYzTE6dLq8rucmbdyJ":{"command":"cat > CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes for Cricket Kerfuffle (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, handoff copy)\n\n1. Humanoid `weapon: 'bat'`: a flat willow cricket bat (handle `colors.grip`, blade `colors.willow`, a sticker band in\n   `colors.trim`, a toe), the length is `bladeLen`; the free hand is drawn on the handle (a two-handed grip). The swing\n   smear and `tip()` treat it like a blade. Why: the rig had swords, guns and staves, and cricket needs a bat.\n2. Humanoid `pads: true`: white batting pads over the knee and shin, with a buckle in `colors.trim`.\n3. Humanoid face furniture: `face: { moustache: 'walrus' | 'handlebar', beard: true, glasses: true }` (colour\n   `colors.facial`, else the hair). Why: the cast (Basil's walrus, Thrumpton's handlebar, Dev's glasses) is the comedy.\n4. Button symbols: the standard Controller setting defaults to PlayStation, with Xbox (A B X Y) as the one other choice\n   (the input's default `glyphs` is 'playstation'). Why: the brief asks for PlayStation glyphs, Xbox from Settings.\n5. Create + Options belongs to the AI Hub: while `game.hubActive` is set and the `hubCreate` action (Pad8) is held,\n   the pause button does not pause (both the main and the extra players' pause checks).\n6. TileMap floor bakes: the cache keeps up to 10 baked floors (was 6), so the match's cameras never re-bake.\nEOF\nmv CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md ../engine-CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md 2>/dev/null; mv ../engine-CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md ./CHANGES-KERFUFFLE.md; ls","description":"Write the engine change log"}}}
